vvenc
------------------------------------------
The Fraunhofer Versatile Video Encoder (VVenC) is a fast and efficient
real-world VVC encoder implementation.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libvvenc-devel-1.14.0-1bl1
  libvvenc1.14-1.14.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/fraunhoferhhi/vvenc

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/fraunhoferhhi/vvenc/archive/refs/tags/v1.14.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack vvenc-1.14.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./vvenc-1.14.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/vvenc-1.14.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/vvenc-1.14.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvvenc1.14-1.14.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvvenc-devel-1.14.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(vvenc)
  /usr/bin/vvencFFapp.exe
  /usr/bin/vvencapp.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/vvenc.README
  /usr/share/doc/vvenc/AUTHORS.md
  /usr/share/doc/vvenc/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/vvenc/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/vvenc/changelog.txt

(libvvenc1.14)
  /usr/bin/cygvvenc-1.14.dll

(libvvenc-devel)
  /usr/include/vvenc/version.h
  /usr/include/vvenc/vvenc.h
  /usr/include/vvenc/vvencCfg.h
  /usr/include/vvenc/vvencDecl.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/vvenc/vvencConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/vvenc/vvencConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/vvenc/vvencTargets-shared-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/vvenc/vvencTargets-shared.cmake
  /usr/lib/libvvenc.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libvvenc.pc

